@startmindmap
* RFC 3262: 100rel / PRACK
** What
*** Reliable 101–199 responses to INVITE
*** 100rel option tag
** Why
*** Progress can be lost
*** PSTN interoperability and transaction extension
** How
*** UAC advertises Supported or Require
*** UAS sends Require: 100rel + RSeq
*** UAC sends PRACK + RAck
*** UAS retransmits until matched
**** Exponential backoff from T1
**** Single outstanding response recommended
** Ordering
*** RSeq starts 1..2**31-1
*** Subsequent values increment exactly one
*** Forking needs independent transaction/dialog tracking per verified errata
** SDP
*** Offer/answer may use reliable 1xx and PRACK
*** Delay INVITE 2xx when unacknowledged SDP is present
** Risks
*** Authenticate PRACK
*** Do not apply to 100 Trying
*** Check verified errata
** Example
*** RAck matches RSeq + CSeq method
@endmindmap
